WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:05.270
November 5, 1868
Matsumae, Ezo

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:55.850
Hakuoki
Demon of the Fleeting Blossom

00:01:56.290 --> 00:02:00.590
Rather than live thousands of futures

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:08.260
I want to fully live this moment right now

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:14.000
Even if we're by the abyss' edge

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:18.470
So long as I am with you as you race ahead

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.100
I will be like the dancing wind

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.180
Even if the irresistible blade of time

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.850
Tears at you until you collapse

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.480
Continue to dream and believe in the light

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.820
As you look up from time to time

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.150
Ah, I would take, ah, your place

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:35.520
If doing so would protect you

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:42.530
Turn into a strong gale, O my prayer

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:48.700
One strong enough to change fate right now

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:57.350
Turn into the wind of dawn, the wind that

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:01.910
Forces open the door to darkness

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:47.200
Episode 21
The Blooming Hepatica

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:50.160
Sendai

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:24.900
Esashi

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:58.830
Goryokaku, Hakodate

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.470
Chizuru Yukimura-sama

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.610
Keisuke Otori
Minister of the Army for
the Republic of Ezo

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.330
Appointment

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.940
Kuwagasaki

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.940
Miyako Bay

00:13:56.970 --> 00:14:06.780
March 1869

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:22.610
March 25, 1869

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:26.480
Miyako Bay

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:41.800
I stare into your face

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:47.840
Illuminated by the dark red setting sun

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:59.950
I softly wish upon the burning sky to stop time

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:11.400
You earnestly try to move forward
as you bear your sadness

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:24.480
If possible, I want to follow
you down this rugged path

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:31.390
The clouds flow by in the far, far distance

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:36.760
Even if this moment lasts but a moment

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:39.860
I want to be with you

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:50.640
The sun that dyes my heart will last forever

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:57.170
So just believe in our bonds

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.120
Next time
The Ephemeral
Pale Cherry Blossom
